#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Runs on every prompt (UserPromptSubmit hook, see .claude/settings.json): reminds Claude to read the current docs first.
cat <<'TXT'
Project rule (CLAUDE.md "Start of every task"): before coding, read docs/decisions.md, the README sections the task touches (§4 FR, §6 ERD, §7/§8 diagrams, §12 actors, Brand), and the last entries of «سجل التنفيذ (ما تم)» at the end of the plan file of the module the task belongs to (docs/plans/<phase>.md). Invoke the arweqah-design-system skill before UI work and module-architecture before API module work. If the task changes behaviour, screens, tables, flows, permissions, env vars or design rules, update README, docs/decisions.md, the log in that same plan file and the design-system skill in the same task. Before saying a task is done run `npm run verify` and report four lines: architecture, design, testing, security (CLAUDE.md "Verify after every task"). Shared code goes in shared places, never copied. Reply to the owner in Arabic.
